title: The Petition of 2000
subtitle: The Delegation demands that the Chancellor return his powers.
tags: event
view-if: finale and not gambit and finale_day >= 3 and not petition_seen
max-visits: 1
priority: 10
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_senate.svg
on-arrival: petition_seen = 1; petition_possible = 1 if senate_resolve >= 3 or delegation_formed

= The Petition of 2000

[? if petition_possible : The Delegation of 2000 has prepared a petition demanding that the Chancellor return his emergency powers to the Senate now that the war is ending. [+ petition_signatures +] additional senators have signed in the last few days. ?][? if not petition_possible : A few senators talk of a petition demanding that the Chancellor return his powers. Too few have the courage to sign it. ?]

- @present: Present it to the Chancellor in person.
- @wait: Hold it back until we know what the Jedi will do.
- @nothing: There is nothing to present.

@present
view-if: petition_possible
subtitle: A public stand. The Chancellor will know exactly who his opponents are.
on-arrival: petition = 1; senate_resolve += 1; faith += 1; pal_relation -= 15; mod_relation += 3; ind_relation += 3

Bail Organa, Mon Mothma[? if padme_alive : and Padmé Amidala ?] carry the petition to the Chancellor's office. Palpatine receives them graciously, thanks them, and promises to "consider it carefully". When they have gone, he summons Mas Amedda and asks for a list of every signatory.

@wait
view-if: petition_possible
subtitle: Keeps our options open.
on-arrival: petition = 0.5; senate_resolve += 0.3

The petition stays in Bail Organa's safe, ready.

@nothing
view-if: not petition_possible
on-arrival: faith -= 1

The moment passes.
